  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"Q5pnk\" id=\"Q5pnk\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a1ad5f8\" id=\"u1a1ad5f8\">输出函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u8ce03ede\" id=\"u8ce03ede\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36873829\" id=\"u36873829\">程序可以通过输出函数将程序执行的数据输出到控制台</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3c4a03b3\" id=\"u3c4a03b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a30dd31\" id=\"u1a30dd31\">Python中的输出函数是</span><code data-lake-id=\"u83f901a8\" id=\"u83f901a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufaf28a00\" id=\"ufaf28a00\">print()</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cnprint(10)%5Cnname%20%3D%20'%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89'%5Cn%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnprint(name)%5Cn%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%A4%9A%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%92%8C%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnprint(10%2Cname)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MlilA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"YwuuA\" id=\"YwuuA\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"udb340860\" id=\"udb340860\">输入函数</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue8f9c332\" id=\"ue8f9c332\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1a21201\" id=\"ud1a21201\">输入函数用来接收用户从控制台输入的数据</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u19943568\" id=\"u19943568\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61eaa518\" id=\"u61eaa518\">Python中的输入数是</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3a13dceb\" id=\"u3a13dceb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube9b0285\" id=\"ube9b0285\">input()</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%AA%5Cnage%20%3D%20input('%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%AA')%5Cnprint(age)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22V9t29%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubb467055\" id=\"ubb467055\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9916ddee\" id=\"u9916ddee\">input输入的数据都为</span><code data-lake-id=\"uefcf1b09\" id=\"uefcf1b09\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ee3285e\" id=\"u6ee3285e\">str</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u665c75cf\" id=\"u665c75cf\">字符串类型</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%AA%5Cnage%20%3D%20input('%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%B9%B4%E7%BA%AA')%5Cn%23%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96age%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnt%20%3D%20type(age)%5Cnprint(t)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H42vs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u75ee32da\" id=\"u75ee32da\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufbc83258\" id=\"ufbc83258\">输出结果:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3Cclass%20'str'%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbe